Choosing to start with this [[bag]] option will cause you to start with a random [[Characters|class]] [[unique]] starting bag, about 1-2 non-class bags, and some non-bag [[items]].
As of version [[Patch_0.9.17|0.9.17]] the total value of all items seem to be 30-31 gold. 

A [[Ranger]] starting with [[Vineweave Basket]], a [[Leather Bag]] and a [[Fanny Pack]], leaves only 3-4 gold worth of other items.<br>
Alternatively, starting with [[Ranger Bag]] and [[Leather Bag]] gives you 10-11 gold worth of other items.

It is possible to get items of higher [[rarity]] from Sack of Surprises, even though the [[Rarity#Probabilities|chance of shop items]] to be epic or higher is 0% at round 1.

